{"unit_id":"CultOfLuna__dsh-vision-autoswitch#card-zh","repo":"CultOfLuna/dsh-vision-autoswitch","commit":"e06123ba3fb50fa5877a9f4bbe1b99d557823ff8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-autoswitch 是一款 DSH 模型路由插件：它在 agent 请求阶段检查当前回合的用户消息和工具结果，发现图片后将该回合改派给配置的视觉模型，默认是 deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp；纯文本回合则恢复到会话记录的原模型。插件还为受支持的文本模型声明图片输入能力，并可把临时切换和回退同步到模型选择栏。适合希望自动处理图片输入、同时保留原文本模型选择的 DSH 用户。需安装到 profile 并注册 layer；应配置可用的视觉 provider 和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:81-151","lib/logic.js:35-57","lib/logic.js:89-125","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
{"unit_id":"CultOfLuna__dsh-vision-autoswitch#card-en","repo":"CultOfLuna/dsh-vision-autoswitch","commit":"e06123ba3fb50fa5877a9f4bbe1b99d557823ff8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-autoswitch routes image turns to a vision model and returns text-only turns to the session’s remembered model. It detects images in user messages and tool results and can sync the model bar. Install it in a DSH profile and configure an available vision model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:81-151","lib/logic.js:35-57","lib/logic.js:89-125","cordis.patch.yml:2-4"]}
