{"unit_id":"CultOfLuna__dsh-vision-autoswitch#feature-1","repo":"CultOfLuna/dsh-vision-autoswitch","commit":"e06123ba3fb50fa5877a9f4bbe1b99d557823ff8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-autoswitch 的功能「图片回合视觉路由」：当前回合的用户内容或工具结果含图片时，将请求改派到配置的视觉 provider 和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/logic.js:35-57","lib/logic.js:106-125"]}
{"unit_id":"CultOfLuna__dsh-vision-autoswitch#feature-2","repo":"CultOfLuna/dsh-vision-autoswitch","commit":"e06123ba3fb50fa5877a9f4bbe1b99d557823ff8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-autoswitch 的功能「原模型回退」：每个会话记住最近一次符合 provider 条件的非视觉模型；没有图片时使用该选择，避免后续文本请求留在视觉模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/logic.js:89-124"]}
{"unit_id":"CultOfLuna__dsh-vision-autoswitch#feature-3","repo":"CultOfLuna/dsh-vision-autoswitch","commit":"e06123ba3fb50fa5877a9f4bbe1b99d557823ff8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-autoswitch 的功能「选择栏同步」：开启 visibleSwitch 时，把请求实际使用的 provider 和模型写入会话选择事件，并在含图回合结束后恢复原模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:139-177"]}
{"unit_id":"CultOfLuna__dsh-vision-autoswitch#feature-4","repo":"CultOfLuna/dsh-vision-autoswitch","commit":"e06123ba3fb50fa5877a9f4bbe1b99d557823ff8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-autoswitch 的功能「图片能力声明」：对允许拦截的 provider，将不含 image 的模型输入模态列表补上 image，使图片请求能通过前置能力检查。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:81-91","lib/logic.js:127-151"]}
